From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: nobody <>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 00:01:12 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] llama: shortlist a host Q6_K or Q8_0 output head

A Q4_K copy bounds every logit, and ggml's own vec_dot fills the rows that can still win, so a clean greedy sample skips the rest of the matrix. Samplers that need the logit tail still get every score. A GPU head stays on mul_mat.
